    <ns0:title>desktop-nightly-20261104233655: feat(core): delegate UX verification to subagents (#15523)</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;feat(core): delegate UX verification to a subagent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fix(agents): preserve delegated tool approval policies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fix(core): preserve worker identity and proxied execution mode&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fix(core): preserve child identity across Hub event projection&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</ns0:content>
